0264-negroni-wlan-ipcr-rings: IPCR data path on MHI channels 20/21 (level 4).
A 576 KiB contiguous transfer buffer: 16 RX x 32 KiB posted on channel 21 after START_CHAN (cnss2
auto_queue, buf_len 0x8000), 8 TX x 8 KiB for channel 20 (negroni_wlan_mhi_tx, one EOT transfer per
packet), transfer events (EOT/EOB/OVERFLOW/DB_MODE, op-kernel mhi main.c:598 parse_xfer_event).
Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0264".

